  "description": "With a pure mind and innocent heart, Xuan Jin-Yu has lived a diligent life as a mother for her daughter Song-Yan. Even her encounter with the vengeful Mr. Spirit, a soul possessing a broken sword, cannot shake her entirely. But when Jin-Yu’s husband sells Song-Yan to make money for gambling, Jin-Yu is forced to work alongside Mr. Spirit to find her daughter. Will Xuan Jin-Yu be able to use martial arts to save the day? Or will the dark thoughts from the malicious spirit consume her mind? \n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
